        <li><a href="../docs/unit-08/index.html">Unit 8: Boss Fight</a> — the spec-to-build pipeline</li>
        <li><a href="../docs/unit-04/enemy-state-machines.html">Enemy State Machines</a> — the pattern your boss extends</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Next: <a href="8.2a.html">8.2a — Boss Body, Health Bar &amp; Phases</a></p>
</div>`;
